.env
/bin/
/tmp/
*.exe

# Generated views (*_templ.go) are deliberately COMMITTED, not ignored:
# the Docker build and a clean CI checkout compile them without needing the
# templ CLI, and committing them is what makes the freshness check in CI
# possible at all — it compares a fresh generate against what is in the tree.

# Uploaded media when `justclick serve` runs outside Compose.
var/
